{"seq":5,"slug":"lc0139-word-break","title":"LeetCode 139 单词拆分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0139-word-break","wordCount":911,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-139-单词拆分\">LeetCode 139 单词拆分</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个字符串 <code>s</code> 和一个字符串列表 <code>wordDict</code> 作为字典。如果可以利用字典中出现的一个或多个单词拼接出 <code>s</code> 则返回 <code>true</code>。</p>\n<p>注意：拼接时字典中的单词可以重复使用。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 ≤ s.length ≤ 300</li>\n<li>1 ≤ wordDict.length ≤ 1000</li>\n<li>1 ≤ wordDict[i].length ≤ 20</li>\n<li>s 和 wordDict[i] 仅由小写英文字母组成</li>\n<li>wordDict 中的所有字符串互不相同</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：s = &quot;leetcode&quot;, wordDict = [&quot;leet&quot;,&quot;code&quot;] 输出：true 解释：&quot;leetcode&quot; 可以由 &quot;leet&quot; + &quot;code&quot; 拼接而成。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：s = &quot;applepenapple&quot;, wordDict = [&quot;apple&quot;,&quot;pen&quot;] 输出：true 解释：&quot;applepenapple&quot; 可以由 &quot;apple&quot; + &quot;pen&quot; + &quot;apple&quot; 拼接而成。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：s = &quot;catsandog&quot;, wordDict = [&quot;cats&quot;,&quot;dog&quot;,&quot;sand&quot;,&quot;and&quot;,&quot;cat&quot;] 输出：false</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题是字符串上的动态规划问题。核心思想是将字符串 <code>s</code> 看作一条&quot;路径&quot;，每个字典中的单词是一个&quot;跳跃步长&quot;，问能否从起点跳到终点。</p>\n<p><strong>状态定义</strong>：<code>dp[i]</code> 表示 <code>s[0..i-1]</code>（前 i 个字符）是否可以被字典中的单词拼接而成。</p>\n<p><strong>状态转移方程</strong>：对于每个位置 <code>i</code>，遍历所有可能的分割点 <code>j</code>（0 ≤ j &lt; i）：如果 <code>dp[j]</code> 为 true 且 <code>s[j..i-1]</code> 在字典中，则 <code>dp[i] = true</code>。</p>\n<p>用 Set 存储字典以实现 O(1) 查找，优化内层循环。</p>\n<p><strong>暴力回溯</strong>：尝试所有可能的分割方式，时间复杂度 O(2ⁿ)。</p>\n<p><strong>记忆化搜索</strong>：在回溯的基础上缓存结果，等价于 DP。</p>\n<p><strong>动态规划（最优解）</strong>：自底向上迭代，时间复杂度 O(n² × k)，其中 k 是单词平均长度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力回溯</td>\n<td>O(2ⁿ)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态规划</td>\n<td>O(n² × k)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>主流解法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DP + 字典优化</td>\n<td>O(n × m × k)</td>\n<td>O(n + m × k)</td>\n<td>m 为字典大小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>标准 DP 解法：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function wordBreak(s: string, wordDict: string[]): boolean {&#10;  const wordSet = new Set(wordDict);&#10;  const n = s.length;&#10;  const dp = new Array(n + 1).fill(false);&#10;  dp[0] = true;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt;= n; i++) {&#10;    for (let j = 0; j &lt; i; j++) {&#10;      if (dp[j] &amp;&amp; wordSet.has(s.slice(j, i))) {&#10;        dp[i] = true;&#10;        break;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dp[n];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wordBreak</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">wordDict</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> wordSet</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(wordDict);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dp[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wordSet.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(j, i))) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dp[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[n];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码逻辑详解：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dp[0] = true</code>：空字符串可以被&quot;拼接&quot;（不需要任何单词）</li>\n<li>外层循环 <code>i</code> 从 1 到 n，表示考虑前 i 个字符</li>\n<li>内层循环 <code>j</code> 从 0 到 i-1，表示在位置 j 处分割</li>\n<li><code>dp[j]</code> 为 true 意味着前 j 个字符可以被拼接</li>\n<li><code>s.slice(j, i)</code> 是从位置 j 到 i-1 的子串</li>\n<li>如果该子串在字典中，说明前 i 个字符也可以被拼接</li>\n<li>找到一个有效分割点就 <code>break</code>，无需继续检查</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>优化版本——从字典侧遍历：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function wordBreakOptimized(s: string, wordDict: string[]): boolean {&#10;  const n = s.length;&#10;  const dp = new Array(n + 1).fill(false);&#10;  dp[0] = true;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt;= n; i++) {&#10;    for (const word of wordDict) {&#10;      const len = word.length;&#10;      if (i &gt;= len &amp;&amp; dp[i - len] &amp;&amp; s.slice(i - len, i) === word) {&#10;        dp[i] = true;&#10;        break;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dp[n];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wordBreakOptimized</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">wordDict</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> word</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wordDict) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> word.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len, i) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> word) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dp[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[n];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当字典较小但字符串较长时，遍历字典比遍历所有分割点更高效。对于每个位置 <code>i</code>，检查每个字典单词 <code>word</code>：如果 <code>dp[i - word.length]</code> 为 true 且 <code>s</code> 的对应子串等于 <code>word</code>，则 <code>dp[i] = true</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>两种遍历方式的比较：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>标准 DP（遍历分割点）：内层复杂度 O(i)，适合字典很大但字符串短的情况</li>\n<li>字典优化（遍历字典）：内层复杂度 O(m × k)，适合字典小但字符串长的情况</li>\n<li>实际应用中，字典通常较小，第二种方式更高效</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>模拟执行（s = &quot;leetcode&quot;, wordDict = [&quot;leet&quot;, &quot;code&quot;]）：</strong></p>\n<p>dp = [T, F, F, F, F, F, F, F, F]</p>\n<ul>\n<li>i=4: dp[0]=T, &quot;leet&quot; ∈ Set → dp[4]=T</li>\n<li>i=8: dp[4]=T, &quot;code&quot; ∈ Set → dp[8]=T</li>\n<li>返回 true</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>标准 DP</th>\n<th>字典优化</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n² × k)</td>\n<td>O(n × m × k)</td>\n<td>k 为子串比较开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>dp 数组 + Set</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本题是字符串 DP 的经典模板。它展示了 DP 在字符串分割/匹配问题中的应用模式：<strong>定义 dp[i] 为前缀是否满足某种性质，枚举最后一段的切分点进行转移</strong>。这一模式在 LC #140（单词拆分 II，返回所有拆分方案）和 LC #472（连接词）中有直接应用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 139 单词拆分","id":"leetcode-139-单词拆分"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 70 爬楼梯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0070-climbing-stairs"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 152 乘积最大子数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0152-maximum-product-subarray"}}